      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">a forest of old growth between us</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Catra and Adora grew up together in foster care. After a violent falling-out near the end of high school, they barely talk or see each other for the next three years. When they do, it goes...poorly.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;So what happens when Catra gets her shit together, transfers from community college to a four-year university, and runs into a certain irritating blonde?&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>samshepard</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
